  datePublished: '2026-08-04',
  author: { '@type': 'Organization', name: 'Kit-Bin' },
  description:
    'PDF compressors mostly work by re-encoding embedded JPEG images — a PDF built from text, vectors, or PNG images has almost nothing for that process to shrink.',
